### Gọi thử API bằng VS Code (extension REST Client) hoặc Visual Studio / Rider (bấm "Send Request").
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Kiểm tra API sống (không cần đăng nhập)
GET {{host}}/health

### 1. Đăng nhập Google: lấy idToken từ Google Sign-In ở frontend rồi dán vào đây
###    Email có trong ADMIN_EMAILS (.env) sẽ là admin hệ thống.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idToken": "PASTE_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN" }

### Token lấy ở bước 1
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ===== Hồ sơ =====
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/users/search?q=an
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== Tạo server (người tạo tự thành chủ server) =====
# @name createServer
POST {{host}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hội đá bóng", "joinPolicy": "RequestToJoin" }

###
@serverId = {{createServer.response.body.id}}

GET {{host}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thêm thành viên
POST {{host}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "USER_ID" }

### Phong quản trị viên (Moderator) / hạ về thành viên (Member)
PUT {{host}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/members/USER_ID/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "Moderator" }

### Giao quyền chủ server
PUT {{host}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "USER_ID" }

### ===== Kênh và tin nhắn =====
# @name channels
GET {{host}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@channelId = {{channels.response.body.categories[0].channels[0].id}}

POST {{host}}/api/conversations/{{channelId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Xin chào cả server 👋" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/conversations/{{channelId}}/messages?take=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tìm kiếm có bộ lọc
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=chào&from=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== File =====
POST {{host}}/api/files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=NebulaBoundary

--NebulaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Xin chào từ Nebula
--NebulaBoundary--

### ===== Thông báo =====
GET {{host}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tắt tiếng kênh 1 giờ (level: All | MentionsOnly | Nothing)
PUT {{host}}/api/notifications/conversations/{{channelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": "All", "mutedUntil": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z" }

### ===== Admin hệ thống =====
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/USER_ID/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Vi phạm nội quy" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/settings/AllowUserCreateServers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "false" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit-logs?take=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
